{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 2860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1360, "text": "Previously on Night Court."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 6700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 3080, "text": "I don't know what I've been doing right\nlately, but in the last three days, I've"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 10320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 6700, "text": "been offered a professorship at\nColumbia, partnership in one of the most"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 15360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10320, "text": "powerful law firms in the country, a\nseat on the Superior Court, and two"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 18340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16940, "text": "Look, I've got to be frank with you."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 21840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 18700, "text": "I just think that Howard Ritter is the\nkind of guy that this country needs."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 23240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22240, "text": "He's smart."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 24480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23480, "text": "So am I."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 26180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25180, "text": "He's dedicated."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 27400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26400, "text": "So am I."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 29780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28620, "text": "He's my brother -in -law."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 36360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31760, "text": "And if the lazy bum lands that big job\nin Washington, he moves out and I"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 37360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36360, "text": "get my den back."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 40540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38440, "text": "I'm not here to talk about the past,\nDan."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 42460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40880, "text": "I'm here to talk about my daughter."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 46600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 43360, "text": "Well, believe me, my feelings for Pamela\nare very genuine."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 52120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47160, "text": "Yes, I'm sure you are deeply in love\nwith her money and all the power and"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 53460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52120, "text": "prestige that go with it."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 58200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54300, "text": "Dan Fielding, I will not allow you to do\nto my daughter what you did to me."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 61040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 59520, "text": "Don't make her fall in love with you."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 63220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 62080, "text": "Give her a chance."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 68200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 67200, "text": "There they are!"}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 69840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 68280, "text": "The people who've been following me!"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 71140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 70140, "text": "One of the art people!"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 73400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72400, "text": "They're aliens!"}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 81530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 77870, "text": "A stunning turnaround is taking place in\nthe 13th congressional district where"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 85730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 81530, "text": "Christine Sullivan has pulled virtually\neven with her opponent, Howard Ritter."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 87830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86350, "text": "You mean I still have a chance?"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 95090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90510, "text": "And we finally have a winner in the 13th\ncongressional district. The winner is"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 99210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95090, "text": "public defender Christine Sullivan. More\nelection returns after this."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 101850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 100850, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 104470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 103470, "text": "I won?"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 165280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 164280, "text": "I hope you're happy."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 167040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 165780, "text": "My life is ruined."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 172440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 168240, "text": "Well, Art, I'm sorry I beat your brother\n-in -law, but I promise you I'll make a"}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 173440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 172440, "text": "great congresswoman."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 176780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 173660, "text": "Who cares about Congress? I'll never get\nthat chump out of my den."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 185040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 182480, "text": "Would you two like to register for my\nfree drawing?"}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 188680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 185240, "text": "You can win a weekend in Cape Canaveral\nwhere you glimpse the top secrets of the"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 189680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 188680, "text": "U .S. space program."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 191300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 190300, "text": "Great."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 195290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 191580, "text": "I have some serious... questions about\nzero gravity and personal hygiene."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 201770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 197810, "text": "Well, NASA isn't going to let some\nraffle winner snoop around their base."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 207170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 202610, "text": "I know that, and you know that, but I'm\nhoping that they..."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 213950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 207170, "text": "don't know that. It's a snare to"}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 215270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 213950, "text": "catch them and prove that they're\naliens."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 218970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 216130, "text": "What are you going to do, beat the truth\nout of them with their shuffleboard"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 219970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 218970, "text": "sticks?"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 222420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 220540, "text": "I know, I'm about to trick him into a\ncat scan."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 226340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224700, "text": "You wanted me, boss?"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 228000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 226680, "text": "Take care of these things pronto."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 233580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 228980, "text": "Um, confirm reservations at Rudy's Stop\nand Bop Motel."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 236480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 235160, "text": "Oil trapeze."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 240760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 237220, "text": "Rewind and return your cassette of\nThrobbing Hood."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 247420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 243540, "text": "I got a ten minute window at lunch. Go\ndown to the steno tool. Book me a"}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 250440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 249320, "text": "Now! Oh, nitwit."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 256320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254180, "text": "Dan, you're a little tough on Will."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 260500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 256620, "text": "Could the Honorable Lady from New York\nplease shut up?"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 264500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262500, "text": "Sir, I've got a messenger for you. Yeah?"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 269340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268340, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 271159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 270200, "text": "what's the good word now?"}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 275040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 271160, "text": "Unbelievable. I've just been offered an\nendorsement contract with Nike."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 281360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 280180, "text": "Call it, Max."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 285020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281960, "text": "Piva versus Susan Landon solicitation."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 287940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 286800, "text": "Mr. Prosecutor?"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 291720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 288220, "text": "Why, yes. The Central Park Police\narrested Miss Landon and the structure"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 294780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 291720, "text": "built in a large elm for the purposes of\nsolicitation."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 298540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 295260, "text": "Wow. A treehouse of ill repute. Oh,"}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 301720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 300260, "text": "shut your squeaky trap."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 306480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 303040, "text": "Must we forever endure your stupid\nasides?"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 309300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 307900, "text": "Lighten up, Counselor."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 312120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 309660, "text": "This is my court, and I will set the\ntone here."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 323440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 318000, "text": "And at the tone... the time will be\nrecess."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 333200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 329340, "text": "Dan, I know you're ticked off about this\nPamela thing, but you have no right to"}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 334440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333200, "text": "take it out on everyone else."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 336320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335320, "text": "How do you know about that?"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 338460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337000, "text": "I heard you talking to her mother."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 341600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339020, "text": "I know why you broke up. Yeah, so what's\nit to you?"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 346120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 342300, "text": "You've already used up one whole\ngeneration of women. Now you're working"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 348760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 346120, "text": "second. You just grow up, Dan."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 352080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 349340, "text": "Why don't you just butt the hell out of\nmy life?"}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 354580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 353580, "text": "Gladly."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 364920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361460, "text": "And if you win, you could be off to the\nNASA Space Center."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 367660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365440, "text": "Hey, Dale, who cares about rocket ships?"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 371020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368679, "text": "Hey, can we win a nice space heater?"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 373160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 372080, "text": "Space heater?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 377400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373600, "text": "Yeah. My feet are always cold. I have\nvery thin blood."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 379280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 378280, "text": "Really?"}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 382940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379580, "text": "The atmosphere is different here. Not\nlike it is back home."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 384160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383160, "text": "I knew it!"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 386540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 385160, "text": "You're not from here, are you?"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 390340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 388660, "text": "Come on, let's see some ID."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 399900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396520, "text": "7 ,000 Aurora Borealis Lane, Jupiter."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 404700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401580, "text": "Jupiter? Florida, Jupiter, Florida. We\nhave a condo down there."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 405960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 404960, "text": "Great view."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 407460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406380, "text": "Of the stars?"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 408940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 407940, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 410840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 409060, "text": "Of the clothing optional beach."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 415500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 413280, "text": "Come on, we've got some great snapshots."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 417880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 415720, "text": "There's one in particular that I want\nyou to see."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 425200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423620, "text": "You want it in court, Dan?"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 430200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429200, "text": "Great."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 445660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 439300, "text": "Order in the court!"}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 447820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446480, "text": "Order in the court!"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 449800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448800, "text": "Ross?"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 451440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450440, "text": "Hi, Dan."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 452920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 451820, "text": "Call it Heidi."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 457000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 453340, "text": "People of the feminine gender versus\nDaniel R."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 458240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 457240, "text": "Fielding."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 465160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463920, "text": "charges. Pick a file."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 466520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465520, "text": "Any file."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 470920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467600, "text": "Wait a minute. Wait a minute. This is a\njoke, right?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 474000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 471740, "text": "That's just what I was going to say\nabout you."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 475880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474540, "text": "And to quote you, Mr."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 478340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 476340, "text": "Fielding, let the games begin!"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 485260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 480880, "text": "Do you want to help me out here,\nChristine?"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 488720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485520, "text": "Well, I'll do the best I can, Dan, but\nI'm having trouble finding any favorable"}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 489780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 488720, "text": "testimony from women."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 491320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 490320, "text": "Oh, please."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 493380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491600, "text": "Couldn't you have at least been nice to\nyour own mother?"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 495720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 493640, "text": "What? She doesn't count."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 500400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497020, "text": "Look, deep down, I'm a sensitive,\nromantic guy."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 501840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 500840, "text": "Oh, yeah, Mr."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 505700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 502080, "text": "Romance? How about that take a number\ndispenser on your bedpost?"}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 506980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505980, "text": "Hold on."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 510080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507340, "text": "That was all in fun."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 511620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 510500, "text": "Fun for whom, Mr."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 514940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511840, "text": "Fielding? Certainly not for all the\nwomen jammed into the gallery or the"}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 515940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514940, "text": "waiting in the hallway."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 518440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516480, "text": "No, because the others lined up around\nthe block."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 521659, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 520039, "text": "Boy, I can draw them, can't I?"}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 525960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523580, "text": "Yes, you're a human pest strip."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 532520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 527200, "text": "Why don't you just drop all this man\n-hating stuff? You know, you wouldn't be"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 535080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532520, "text": "half bad if you lost those glasses and\nyour brother's suit."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 542700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 537040, "text": "Hey, Dan made me pay for every meal I\never ate with him. You cheap bum."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 545460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543200, "text": "But I always gave you dessert, Tam."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 551710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549550, "text": "card to book two weeks in Acapulco."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 552990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 551970, "text": "I paid you back."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 554570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553350, "text": "But you took Tammy."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 562830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 558290, "text": "Please proceed, Ms. Maddox. Your Honor,\nevery woman in this room has a complaint"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 563830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 562830, "text": "about Mr."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 566450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563950, "text": "Fielding's insensitive and selfish\nbehavior."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 568570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 566790, "text": "Your Honor, I object. That's purely\nspeculative."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 570590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 569050, "text": "I love it when you're passionate."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 573550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 571990, "text": "Remember me, Dan?"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 576770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573990, "text": "You said I'd win the pageant if I slept\nwith you."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 579150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 577370, "text": "You were Miss Congeniality?"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 581030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579870, "text": "Boy, was she ever."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 583790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582690, "text": "Dan, you're not helping."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 585970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584170, "text": "Dan Fielding, you're a big fat liar."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 588270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 587170, "text": "I am not fat."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 598170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592510, "text": "He never called after our first date. He\nmade me jump out of a cake on my"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 601530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 598170, "text": "birthday. He made me jump out of a cake\non Washington's birthday."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 613320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612300, "text": "of the jury."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 615200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 613620, "text": "Well, come on now."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 617880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 616580, "text": "Think about it."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 622260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 618840, "text": "Did I ever really give you any reason to\ncomplain?"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 630280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 627220, "text": "Wasn't I always Dan the man?"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 634800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631240, "text": "All right, so maybe I didn't pay enough\nattention sometimes."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 639420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 636520, "text": "Occasionally, I used the wrong choice of\nwords."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 644440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 639740, "text": "Like, for instance, bop, bump, hump,\ngrind, pork, cork, and boink."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 650860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649040, "text": "And don't forget the phrases."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 652440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 651220, "text": "Shucking the corn."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 654060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 652820, "text": "Kissing the blarney stone."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 655780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654280, "text": "Doing the mattress mumbo."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 660040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 656140, "text": "Christine, just feel free to jump in\nhere any time now. How about hitting the"}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 660799, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660040, "text": "grand slam?"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 661759, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660800, "text": "Hey, Christine."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 663440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 661760, "text": "Sorry, I'm sorry. It was just so easy."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 667780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 664060, "text": "At every turn, Mr. Fielding has used the\nvery spirit of female trust and"}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 669980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 667780, "text": "generosity. May I present..."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 671429, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 670530, "text": "Exhibit A."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 676130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671430, "text": "His grandmother's wedding ring and\nalleged family heirloom. Be very careful"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 678070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 676130, "text": "that. It is one of a kind."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 682190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 678890, "text": "That belonged to my dear departed\ngranny, the woman who taught me how to"}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 685110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 682190, "text": "and respect the gentle gender."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 687710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 686710, "text": "Nice try."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 692870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689310, "text": "How many women here possess the one of a\nkind family heirloom?"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 703520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 702440, "text": "special to me."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 706620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 705140, "text": "Closing arguments, Counselor."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 709420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 707080, "text": "Dan Fielding's day of reckoning has\ncome."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 713960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709880, "text": "The testimony in this courtroom today\nhas sealed the fate of a man who has"}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 718540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713960, "text": "his entire life thinking only of himself\nat the expense of every woman he has"}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 719540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 718540, "text": "ever known."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 725080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722920, "text": "Miss Sullivan?"}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 729160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 725980, "text": "Your Honor, how can all those accusers\nbe wrong?"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 734500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729800, "text": "Dan Fielding is a pathetic, boorish,\nwomanizing louse of a man. And he is"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 736340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 734500, "text": "guilty. And don't sugarcoat it."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 739040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 737520, "text": "He's guilty of one thing."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 741060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 739640, "text": "Of loving women."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 744560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 741540, "text": "Maybe not in the way we'd like to be\nloved, but he does the best he can."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 749680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 744920, "text": "And beneath that slimy exterior beats\nthe heart of a truly sensitive man."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 751720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 750480, "text": "I've seen Dan with women."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 757360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 751960, "text": "And even if it's only for five minutes,\nfor those five minutes, he's made them"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 758640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 757360, "text": "the center of his universe."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 762490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 760330, "text": "Ladies, look into your hearts."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 765850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763130, "text": "Wasn't that five minutes worth it?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 770670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 769550, "text": "Thank you, Christine."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 773310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772090, "text": "You've saved me."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 775390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 774110, "text": "Not necessarily."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 780470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 776510, "text": "Dan Fielding, this court finds you\nguilty on all charges of disrespect,"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 784990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 780930, "text": "insensitivity, and overall crappy\nbehavior toward women."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 805940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804940, "text": "just my tie."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 809920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 807020, "text": "I'm okay. I'm alive."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 816840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 813460, "text": "And I've got the answer."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 827720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 822760, "text": "All right. The moment of truth."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 830380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828440, "text": "Where will my future be?"}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 833920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832420, "text": "Eenie, meenie, miney, moe."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 837930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 836930, "text": "Columbia University."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 840990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 839990, "text": "Unanimous folks."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 845130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 843690, "text": "Hey, good news, Mac."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 847390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845330, "text": "I made my decision. What is it?"}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 850330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 847630, "text": "Touring with Miltormia, becoming an\nexotic dancer."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 853790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 850970, "text": "You know I chafe in hot pants."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 857290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 854850, "text": "I'm going to take the professorship at\nColumbia University."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 859770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 858010, "text": "Well, good for you, sir."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 861159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 860200, "text": "What made you decide?"}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 863960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861160, "text": "Well, it was a tough choice, but it's\nlike you always say, you gotta go with"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 867240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 863960, "text": "your first instincts. Right you are. You\ngotta reach for your dreams. Set your"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 870480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 867240, "text": "marks high. Grab the brass ring. Go for\nthe gusto."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 871900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870900, "text": "Quit law school."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 876600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 872740, "text": "What are you talking about? I haven't\neven taken the job yet. No, no, me."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 877960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876960, "text": "I'm quitting law school."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 879700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 878700, "text": "What do you mean?"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 882380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880180, "text": "Well, I've been accepted to film school,\nHarry."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 884900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882800, "text": "I want to make movies. I can't deny it."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 887620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 886340, "text": "Well, then you shouldn't."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 889180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 888180, "text": "Hey."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 894310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892869, "text": "Well, I gotta get back to work."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 897450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896450, "text": "Mac? Yeah?"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 900930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 898050, "text": "You're not gonna forget me when you\nbecome a famous director, are you?"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 902670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901670, "text": "Of course I will."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 906710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905130, "text": "But it won't be anytime soon."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 910090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908890, "text": "Mac, Mac, Mac."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 913270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912270, "text": "Bye, Christine."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 914930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 913930, "text": "Bye,"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 917530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915870, "text": "Christine. I'm gonna miss that."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 927710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 923950, "text": "I got some good news. Oh, good. I could\nuse some. It's my last night, you know."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 931330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 927890, "text": "Yeah, you're starting a new job. You\nmust feel great, huh?"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 934030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 931570, "text": "I mean, excited and hopeful,\nexhilarated."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 935570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934570, "text": "Actually depressed."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 937349, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936390, "text": "What's the matter?"}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 940330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937350, "text": "Well, Harry, everywhere I turn is a\nreminder of what I'm leaving behind."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 943130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942130, "text": "Such as?"}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 945850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 943910, "text": "The smell of the hallway floor cleaner."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 955830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953770, "text": "The dingy green courtroom walls."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 961870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 957350, "text": "Well, let's not forget the musty scent\nthat wafts up from holding on the summer"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 962870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 961870, "text": "nights."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 965030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 964030, "text": "How could I?"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 969190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 967070, "text": "Christine, I'm confused. I thought you\nwere happy."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 973070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 969430, "text": "Oh, no, I am happy about being elected.\nIt's just that I guess I never realized"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 974070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 973070, "text": "how much I'd be giving up."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 976890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974330, "text": "Hey, I'm sure Congress has dingy walls,\ntoo."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 980650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977810, "text": "No, no, it's not that. It's making a\nmark."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 983190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981470, "text": "It's... really making a difference."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 986690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 984210, "text": "You mean keeping those wheels of justice\nspinning?"}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 990830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 989130, "text": "Fifty -five dollars and time served."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 997070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993590, "text": "Oh, Harry, this whole building really\nmeans a lot to me."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 999710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 998250, "text": "It's where I've done my best work."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1002810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000930, "text": "It's where I've found my closest\nfriends."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1006210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1003510, "text": "It's where I've even had my baby."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1008190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007190, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1011460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1009000, "text": "I always thought we should have retired\nthat elevator car."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1017220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013480, "text": "Well, if we were to start doing that,\nevery inch of this dumb old building"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1019120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1017220, "text": "be a sentimental landmark for me."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1023220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1021200, "text": "Well, I guess I'm just being silly, huh?"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1026380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025380, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1029400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1028400, "text": "Silly."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1034460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1031760, "text": "Well, if you'll excuse me, I'm going to\ngo."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1038770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1035149, "text": "Watch them scrape the gum off the\ngallery benches one last time."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1052930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050430, "text": "Oh, to hell with the gum. I'm going to\nmiss you the most."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1062110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1060590, "text": "$55 in time, sir."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1068500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066060, "text": "Uh, Your Honor, you know those two\npeople who've been following me?"}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1069899, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069120, "text": "Yeah, Bull?"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1070719, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069900, "text": "Good news."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1071720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070720, "text": "They're not aliens."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1073820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072180, "text": "They're retired chestnut benders."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1076220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1075160, "text": "That's good news, Bull."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1078060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1077020, "text": "And they're my friends."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1082180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1081180, "text": "Good Bull."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1085580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1084160, "text": "Last case of the night, sir."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1086880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1085880, "text": "Call it, Mac."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1089860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1086920, "text": "Oh, that's the last time I'll ever hear\nyou say call it, Mac."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1092420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090580, "text": "People versus Burke and Merrill."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1094840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093020, "text": "That's the last case I'll ever hear Matt\ncall."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1098040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096820, "text": "Mr. Prosecutor."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1102800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098700, "text": "Your Honor, officers arrested Messrs.\nBurke and Merrill on the fire escape of"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1106280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102800, "text": "their brownstone office where a fight\nensued when Mr. Burke tried to push Mr."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1108220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1106420, "text": "Merrill's piano to the street below."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1112420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108560, "text": "Sir, Burke and Merrill are songwriters\nwith a 40 -year partnership which"}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1113740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112420, "text": "apparently they wish to dissolve."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1115400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1114400, "text": "Burke and Merrill?"}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1117640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1116420, "text": "I know your songs."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1121820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1119780, "text": "Gentlemen, let me shake your hands."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1123350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1122190, "text": "You really know our songs?"}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1124690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1123690, "text": "Oh, yes, I do."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1131650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125310, "text": "You know, one of the earliest memories I\nhave of my mom is her singing me one of"}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1132489, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1131650, "text": "your songs."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1133490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1132490, "text": "Let me guess."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1135110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133770, "text": "Rock -a -bye baby blues?"}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1137850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1135550, "text": "No, molasses pie and a coffee high."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1140450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139070, "text": "One of my best lyrics."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1142130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1140810, "text": "One of my best melodies."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1144390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1142470, "text": "One of Burke and Merrill's best songs."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1146110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144670, "text": "Hey, you've got a good memory, Judge."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1149910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1147930, "text": "Memories are all I have of my mom."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1154429, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153429, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1155810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1154810, "text": "You're welcome."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1159490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156490, "text": "Once in a while we found something that\nworked, I guess."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1161230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1159830, "text": "Yeah. Yeah."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1166570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1162390, "text": "I guess when it's gone, it's gone, huh?\nSo what do you say, why don't we try a"}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1168250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1166570, "text": "restraining order? That ought to settle\nthis."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1169309, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168450, "text": "Hey, wait a minute."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1171770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1169310, "text": "Can't a couple of guys have an innocent\ndifference of opinion?"}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1175310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1172090, "text": "Well, sure you can, as long as that\ndoesn't include attempted murder with a"}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1177490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175310, "text": "piano. Hey, we're artists."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1178910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1177910, "text": "We're nuts."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1182230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1181170, "text": "We won't do it again."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1187310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1183210, "text": "Well, how would the counsels feel about\nmoving to dismiss these charges, seeing"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1190210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187310, "text": "as harmony has been restored to this\npartnership?"}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1191830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1190830, "text": "So moved."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1193810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192810, "text": "Ditto."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1195810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194810, "text": "Case dismissed."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1200710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199710, "text": "Christine?"}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1202590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201590, "text": "Are you ready?"}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1204510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202990, "text": "Isn't there anyone left in holding?"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1208510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1207510, "text": "It's a wrap."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1211550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1210490, "text": "Court's adjourned."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1223620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220880, "text": "To Christine Sullivan, colleague and\nfriend."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1225920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1224260, "text": "She belongs to the people now."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1230080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1226580, "text": "But she will always be here in our\nhearts."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1231760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1230760, "text": "All right."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1232940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231940, "text": "Thanks,"}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1235460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1234460, "text": "guys."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1241580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236740, "text": "I... You have been..."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1246740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1241580, "text": "You know... There she is."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1249020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1247260, "text": "The next Speaker of the House."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1255470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1252490, "text": "Hey, doesn't somebody else have a\ndecision to share with his friends?"}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1257710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1255890, "text": "Harry? You made a choice, Harry."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1259010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258010, "text": "Where are you going?"}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1261630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1260630, "text": "The courtroom."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1263570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1262570, "text": "I'm going to stay."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1265390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1264390, "text": "You've got to be kidding."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1266810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265810, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1268550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1267370, "text": "This is where I belong."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1270510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1269350, "text": "I do make a difference."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1275410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271450, "text": "Look at Burke and Merrill. They left\ntogether tonight because somehow I was"}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1276550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1275410, "text": "to strike a chord with them."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1278530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1277450, "text": "This is my world."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1281490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279630, "text": "The way I see it, some of us are..."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1286000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282100, "text": "meant for greatness, and others are\nmeant to hold down the fort."}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1291140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1287140, "text": "Plus, you'd miss that musty smell that\nwafts up from holding on summer nights."}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1292300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1291300, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1295900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1294240, "text": "Harry, could I talk to you in the hall a\nsecond?"}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1313180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1311440, "text": "If this is a chain letter, you're fired."}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1316700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1315440, "text": "It is my letter of resignation."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1318740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1317740, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1320080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1318920, "text": "I have to follow my heart."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1321640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1320640, "text": "I'm leaving."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1322960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1321960, "text": "I'm on a mission."}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1325380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1323460, "text": "I'm chasing the woman of my dreams."}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1327220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1326220, "text": "Don't you always?"}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1331360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1330360, "text": "This is different."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1333240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1331780, "text": "It's been building up for years."}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1337320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1334860, "text": "She's the only woman who's ever really\nunderstood me."}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1338960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1337960, "text": "You have to quit?"}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1340600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1339480, "text": "Yes, of course. I'm moving."}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1345320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1341480, "text": "I'm going to dedicate all my time and\nenergy to winning her heart."}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1348800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1347020, "text": "Winning her heart? You mean she doesn't\nfeel the same?"}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1351180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1349020, "text": "Oh, well, don't be silly. She doesn't\neven know yet."}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1353580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1352340, "text": "Listen, I got to go."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1357620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1356620, "text": "Bye, Harry."}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1363160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1360100, "text": "Dan, who's the lucky girl?"}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1365720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1364720, "text": "Christine."}
{"cue": 375, "end_ms": 1380050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1379050, "text": "Good night, sir."}
{"cue": 376, "end_ms": 1381210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1380210, "text": "Hey."}
{"cue": 377, "end_ms": 1384230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1381710, "text": "You're not going anywhere, are you? Are\nyou kidding?"}
{"cue": 378, "end_ms": 1386430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1384430, "text": "I just bought five new sets of\nhandcuffs."}
{"cue": 379, "end_ms": 1389590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1388590, "text": "Buy you a beer?"}
{"cue": 380, "end_ms": 1390830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1389830, "text": "Sure."}
{"cue": 381, "end_ms": 1400510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1396310, "text": "Hey, Harry, you lucky dog. You won my...\ndrawing."}
{"cue": 382, "end_ms": 1404850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1403850, "text": "Hmm."}
{"cue": 383, "end_ms": 1409640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1408240, "text": "Hi, Norm. Hi, Angelo."}
{"cue": 384, "end_ms": 1411019, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1410040, "text": "What's up?"}
{"cue": 385, "end_ms": 1413800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1411020, "text": "Bull, we've decided to take you to\nJupiter."}
{"cue": 386, "end_ms": 1416220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1414660, "text": "Florida? No, no, Bull."}
{"cue": 387, "end_ms": 1418900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1417020, "text": "Jupiter, the planet."}
{"cue": 388, "end_ms": 1421720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1420280, "text": "But you said you weren't aliens."}
{"cue": 389, "end_ms": 1424180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1423180, "text": "We lied."}
{"cue": 390, "end_ms": 1427480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1426300, "text": "Bull, we need you."}
{"cue": 391, "end_ms": 1430500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1427760, "text": "You can help us solve our most pressing\nproblem."}
{"cue": 392, "end_ms": 1432700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1430980, "text": "Why, you'd be a hero."}
{"cue": 393, "end_ms": 1434140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1432960, "text": "You'd have a real purpose."}
{"cue": 394, "end_ms": 1436760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1434560, "text": "You mean, I'd be somebody?"}
{"cue": 395, "end_ms": 1438060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1437060, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 396, "end_ms": 1441830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1438550, "text": "You'd be the guy who would reach the\nstuff on our top shelves."}
{"cue": 397, "end_ms": 1446670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1445430, "text": "So, will you come?"}
{"cue": 398, "end_ms": 1452610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1451610, "text": "Okay."}
